<title>USA: Newport News Q4 shr $0.09.</title>
<headline>Newport News Q4 shr $0.09.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT NEWS, Va. 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Newport News Shipbuilding Inc.</p>
<p>	     Dollars in Millions, Except Per Share Amounts</p>
<p>					  Fourth Quarter  Twelve Months</p>
<p>					  1996    1995	1996   1995</p>
<p> Net Sales			     $433   $466    $1,870 $1,756</p>
<p> Operating Costs and Expenses     409    434     1,729  1,599</p>
<p> Other Income (Expense), net	(1)	3	 (1)	3</p>
<p>Earnings Before Interest and Taxes</p>
<p>					     23     35	 140    160</p>
<p> Interest Expense (Net)	    (13)    (3)	(38)   (29)</p>
<p>Earnings Before Income Taxes	10     32	 102    131</p>
<p> Provision for Income Taxes	   7     17	  47     58</p>
<p> Net Earnings			     3     15	  55     73</p>
<p> Earnings Per Share -- Reported  0.09     --	1.60     --</p>
<p>			  -- Adjusted*   --     --	1.36     --</p>
<p> Ending Shares at 12/31/96	   --     --	34.3     --</p>
<p>(in Millions)</p>
<p>NOTE: Adjusted EPS reflects interest expense as if the company's new capital structure had been in place on January 1, 1996.</p>
<p>Earnings for the fourth quarter included $11 million in charges related to increased estimated final costs on product tanker contracts, and $5 million of professional fees and administrative costs associated with the spinoff from Tenneco Inc. These charges were partially mitigated by increased volume in the overhaul segment.</p>
